+runs per method. Each row applies the indicated componentwise relaxation in normalized
+objective coordinates. Colors give the fraction of runs with a feasible point weakly dominating
+the relaxed target. Targets and relaxations are post-hoc analysis conventions.}
+\label{fig:revision_attainment}
+\end{figure}
